flowchart TD
    START([Start: User Opens Financial Insights Screen]) --> AUTH[Flutter Calls GET /api/insights/user/userId with JWT]
    AUTH --> AUTHCK{JWT Valid?}
    AUTHCK -- No --> UNAUTH[Return 401 Unauthorized]
    UNAUTH --> ERRD[Display Error and Redirect to Login]
    ERRD --> DONE([End])
    AUTHCK -- Yes --> DATES[Determine Current Month and Previous Month]
    DATES --> CURTXN[Fetch Current Month Transactions from TRANSACTIONS]
    CURTXN --> PREVTXN[Fetch Previous Month Transactions from TRANSACTIONS]
    PREVTXN --> AGG[Aggregate Each Set: Total Income, Total Expense, Per-Category Expense]
    AGG --> BUDGET[Fetch Active Budget from BUDGETS for Current Month]
    BUDGET --> BUDGETCK{Budget Found?}
    BUDGETCK -- Yes --> BUDGETLIM[Use TotalBudget as Budget Limit]
    BUDGETCK -- No --> BUDGETNEUTRAL[Budget Pillar Defaults to Neutral: 12.5 pts]
    BUDGETLIM --> GOALS
    BUDGETNEUTRAL --> GOALS[Fetch All Goals from GOALS - Count Completed]
    GOALS --> PILLARA[Pillar A: Savings Rate - 0 to 25 pts\n20% savings rate = full marks]
    PILLARA --> PILLARB[Pillar B: Budget Adherence - 0 to 25 pts\nWithin budget = full marks]
    PILLARB --> PILLARC[Pillar C: Spending Consistency - 0 to 25 pts\nWithin 10% of last month = full marks]
    PILLARC --> PILLARD[Pillar D: Goal Progress - 0 to 25 pts\nCompleted goals / Total goals]
    PILLARD --> SCORE[Sum Pillars and Clamp to 0-100]
    SCORE --> LABEL{Score Range?}
    LABEL -- 80-100 --> EXCELLENT[Label: Excellent - Green]
    LABEL -- 60-79 --> GOOD[Label: Good - Teal]
    LABEL -- 40-59 --> FAIR[Label: Fair - Orange]
    LABEL -- 0-39 --> NEEDS[Label: Needs Work - Red]
    EXCELLENT --> INSIGHTS
    GOOD --> INSIGHTS
    FAIR --> INSIGHTS
    NEEDS --> INSIGHTS[Generate 4-6 Insight Cards\nTypes: positive / info / warning / danger]
    INSIGHTS --> RESP[Return JSON: Score, Label, Pillars, Summary, Insight Cards]
    RESP --> TXNCK{Transactions Exist?}
    TXNCK -- No --> EMPTY[Display Empty State Prompt]
    EMPTY --> DONE
    TXNCK -- Yes --> RENDER[Flutter Renders:\n1. Circular Score Gauge\n2. Pillar Breakdown Bars\n3. Monthly Summary Row\n4. Insight Cards with Colour Borders]
    RENDER --> REFRESH{User Pull-to-Refresh?}
    REFRESH -- Yes --> AUTH
    REFRESH -- No --> DONE
